WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
[No sound] The front of Sunshine Nursery: a red gable with our sign.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Cloud-shaped boards show our phone number and "Open 7.30am to 6pm, all year round".

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.500
A table set up for small construction, with blue chairs.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.500
The under-2s play room: a slide, a toy kitchen and a rocking horse.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.500
A carpeted room with a play tunnel and a small trampoline.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.500
Low tables and blue chairs, with children's handprint paintings on the wall.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.500
A corner with a toy workbench, wooden blocks and a road mat.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.000
The garden: a learning shed, a climbing dome and tree-stump seats.
